{
    "title": "NASCAR MOBILE",
    "description": "Stay up to speed with all the excitement of the NASCAR season with the Official App of NASCAR!\r\n\r\nBrand new for 2024:\r\n\r\nEnhanced live leaderboard data with premium subscription:\r\n- Fuel and Tire condition\r\n- Live Telemetry \r\n- Pit Stop Stats\r\n\r\n\u25ba Free Features Include:\r\n\r\nRace Center\r\n\r\nLeaderboard - Live Race, Qualifying, and Practice Leaderboards for all NASCAR Series\r\n\r\nLive Activities - Follow the race from your lock or home screen using iOS 16.1+\r\n\r\nScanner - Live radio broadcast for all NASCAR Series\r\n\r\nTimeline - Access to lap by lap information and in-race highlights for all NASCAR Series\r\n\r\nCompare - Compare driver live data including position, speed, and time data\r\n\r\nWeather - View hourly weather forecast from track\r\n\r\nBetting Odds\r\n\r\nDrive\r\n\r\nLive On-Track and In-Car Driver Cameras for NASCAR Cup and Xfinity Series\r\n\r\nFull-Field of In-Car Cameras for NASCAR Cup Series races\r\n\r\nSchedule and ticket information\r\n\r\nDriver, manufacturer, and owner standings\r\n\r\nHistorical race replays with NASCAR Classics\r\n\r\nEarn Points and redeem for prizes with NASCAR Fan Rewards\r\n\r\nPlay NASCAR Fantasy Live and compete against your friends for prizes\r\n\r\nCustomized notifications including series specific alerts and live event reminders\r\n\r\n\u25ba Premium Features Include (Subscription Required):\r\n\r\nNo Ads or Commercials\r\n\r\nEnhanced Leaderboard data for Cup, Xfinity, and Truck\r\n\r\nLive Telemetry\r\n\r\nScanner (Premium)\r\n\r\nUnfiltered audio between drivers, crew chiefs, and spotters for all NASCAR Series races\r\n\r\nNASCAR officials radio is available for all NASCAR Series races\r\n\r\nVideo section features\r\n\r\nChromecast - cast video to compatible TV/device\r\n\r\nPicture in Picture - allows you to watch videos while using other apps\r\n\r\nCertain restrictions apply as some Premium Features are not available for all NASCAR series events.\r\n\r\nFor your convenience, here are links to our terms of use and privacy policy:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.nascar.com/terms-of-use\r\nhttps://www.nascar.com/privacy-statement",
    "descriptionHTML": "Stay up to speed with all the excitement of the NASCAR season with the Official App of NASCAR!<br><br>Brand new for 2024:<br><br>Enhanced live leaderboard data with premium subscription:<br>- Fuel and Tire condition<br>- Live Telemetry <br>- Pit Stop Stats<br><br>\u25ba Free Features Include:<br><br>Race Center<br><br>Leaderboard - Live Race, Qualifying, and Practice Leaderboards for all NASCAR Series<br><br>Live Activities - Follow the race from your lock or home screen using iOS 16.1+<br><br>Scanner - Live radio broadcast for all NASCAR Series<br><br>Timeline - Access to lap by lap information and in-race highlights for all NASCAR Series<br><br>Compare - Compare driver live data including position, speed, and time data<br><br>Weather - View hourly weather forecast from track<br><br>Betting Odds<br><br>Drive<br><br>Live On-Track and In-Car Driver Cameras for NASCAR Cup and Xfinity Series<br><br>Full-Field of In-Car Cameras for NASCAR Cup Series races<br><br>Schedule and ticket information<br><br>Driver, manufacturer, and owner standings<br><br>Historical race replays with NASCAR Classics<br><br>Earn Points and redeem for prizes with NASCAR Fan Rewards<br><br>Play NASCAR Fantasy Live and compete against your friends for prizes<br><br>Customized notifications including series specific alerts and live event reminders<br><br>\u25ba Premium Features Include (Subscription Required):<br><br>No Ads or Commercials<br><br>Enhanced Leaderboard data for Cup, Xfinity, and Truck<br><br>Live Telemetry<br><br>Scanner (Premium)<br><br>Unfiltered audio between drivers, crew chiefs, and spotters for all NASCAR Series races<br><br>NASCAR officials radio is available for all NASCAR Series races<br><br>Video section features<br><br>Chromecast - cast video to compatible TV/device<br><br>Picture in Picture - allows you to watch videos while using other apps<br><br>Certain restrictions apply as some Premium Features are not available for all NASCAR series events.<br><br>For your convenience, here are links to our terms of use and privacy policy:<br><br>https://www.nascar.com/terms-of-use<br>https://www.nascar.com/privacy-statement",
